 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대구시에서는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2016</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년부터 대학생의 과중한 등록금부담을 완화시켜 학업과 취업에 전념할 수 있도록 대학생 학자금대출 부감경감 지원 사업을 실시하고 있으니 해당 학생은 참고바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">□ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">사업개요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">사 업 명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대구시 대학생 학자금대출 부담경감 지원 사업</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지원신청 대상자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- (</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학자금대출 이자 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) ’17.9.11.</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">현재 본인 또는 직계존속이 대구에 주민등록을 둔 대구경북 소재 대학 재적생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">휴학생과 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">’17</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 가을학기 졸업생 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업생 및 대학원생 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">으로서 소득</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">8</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">분위이내이거나 다자녀가구의 대학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- (</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학자금대출 신용회복 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) ’17.9.11.</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">현재 본인이 대구에 주민등록을 두고 한국장학재단 학자금대출 신용유의정보 등록된 만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">34</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">세</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(1982.9.12.</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이후 출생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이하의 청년</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: 10. 31.(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">인터넷 접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대구광역시 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(www.daegu.go.kr)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIG